{
  "title": "Kicked Light German Chickpea Stew",
  "description": "A fermented and light German stew made with chickpea flour, perfect for the monsoon season. This dish is egg-free and cooked in a traditional cazuela.",
  "cuisine": "German",
  "diet": [
